{"4452670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rocket Man X", "steam_appid": 4452670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil group of toys, calling themselves the action figure elite, have taken over the world. In 24 hours they will wipe out all of humanity. Only Rocket Man X can stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight Enemies</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your fireworks to fight through areas that have been infested with evil toys. Clear out a steel factory that has been flooded with lava. Rescue capture humans from the berry plantation. And make the beaches safe again. After clearing all 8 major areas, you can finally strike at the AFE's headquarters for some final challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/108b3a3b189542e86407f64211576cb3.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/108b3a3b189542e86407f64211576cb3.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/108b3a3b189542e86407f64211576cb3.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Platform</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you move and jump, but you can also wall kick to climb walls. You can also dash. Dash through the air to get some extra distance, or dash into your foes to deal some damage to them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/b738d51a9e0ad52dd28a49c3b338c911.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/b738d51a9e0ad52dd28a49c3b338c911.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/b738d51a9e0ad52dd28a49c3b338c911.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Find Collectables</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearts and armor are scattered throughout the world. There is one piece in each of the 8 main levels. Collect hearts to increase your maximum health. Each piece of armor has a unique effect. One may give you an additional air dash, one may allow you to break new objects, and one may just half all incoming damage. In some levels you can even find energy storing tanks, which can collect fallen health when your health is full, and use them later. Not all of these will be easy to find, but you can always return to a level to find them later.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/d6216cd025a3d38de2cd448bf0444fc4.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/d6216cd025a3d38de2cd448bf0444fc4.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/d6216cd025a3d38de2cd448bf0444fc4.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/bc0165af8f156a1ef4c3d4b2dad4f901.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/bc0165af8f156a1ef4c3d4b2dad4f901.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/bc0165af8f156a1ef4c3d4b2dad4f901.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlock New Weapons</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating one of the 8 main bosses, you will unlock one of their weapons to use yourself. These weapons will (for the most part) have a limited source of ammo. But fear not. Defeating enemies will sometimes result in them dropping ammo orbs. Collecting these orbs will restore ammo to every weapon you have.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/b918810702d1ba234c5cccdf1b4aaa65.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/b918810702d1ba234c5cccdf1b4aaa65.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/b918810702d1ba234c5cccdf1b4aaa65.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/f34d962cedf81e5be4b9014903d50534.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/f34d962cedf81e5be4b9014903d50534.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/f34d962cedf81e5be4b9014903d50534.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Purchase Accessories.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins are scattered across the lands. enemies and destructible objects will also drop coins. The more health the enemy has, and the more valuable the object, the more coins they will drop. You can use these coins in the shop to purchase accessories: 4 minor upgrades that can be applied at a time. Which 4 you may choose before entering a level. These usually have smaller effects that the armor, such as increasing your speed or decreasing the amount of ammo used when a weapon is fired. You can also buy hats, which have no effect on gameplay, but does look cool.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/4f66af730917335ce74ac590df6d0101.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/4f66af730917335ce74ac590df6d0101.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/4f66af730917335ce74ac590df6d0101.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Drive Cool Rides.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some levels, you may find vehicles to help you on your journey, each with its own unique set of moves.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/f871bbb5b15bfb25d0d044aa6dc2a813.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/f871bbb5b15bfb25d0d044aa6dc2a813.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/f871bbb5b15bfb25d0d044aa6dc2a813.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/ad7cc18d80b664083183ff9dd937e7dc.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/ad7cc18d80b664083183ff9dd937e7dc.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/ad7cc18d80b664083183ff9dd937e7dc.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil group of toys, calling themselves the action figure elite, have taken over the world. In 24 hours they will wipe out all of humanity. Only Rocket Man X can stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight Enemies</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your fireworks to fight through areas that have been infested with evil toys. Clear out a steel factory that has been flooded with lava. Rescue capture humans from the berry plantation. And make the beaches safe again. After clearing all 8 major areas, you can finally strike at the AFE's headquarters for some final challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/108b3a3b189542e86407f64211576cb3.poster.avif?t=1788272783\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/108b3a3b189542e86407f64211576cb3.webm?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452670/extras/108b3a3b189542e86407f64211576cb3.mp4?t=1788272783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><